  "details": "The way the program works now, it will show the name of the project, and the date it was last edited. It would be nice if there was some way to add a thumbnail to visually represent the project, since sometimes names alone aren't enough to keep everything organized in one's head-- if I need to edit something that I haven't touched in a while and the name doesn't fully explain what the project is (Particularly possible if downloaded from Booth or another language website). \n\nThis thumbnail can be the same image chosen by the user for use on VRChat, or in some way copied from the upload itself (as in, the same one 'captured from project'), OR if the user so wishes, not used at all; in my mind it's purely a cosmetic choice determined entirely by the user's needs. But it would be *very* helpful.",
